{
    "chapter_num": 7,
    "verses_count": 14,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Obedience Better than Fasting"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now in the fourth year of King Darius it came to pass "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the word of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " came to Zechariah, on the fourth "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "day"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the ninth month, Chislev, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "when "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. they, cf. v. 5"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the people"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " sent "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or Sar-Ezer"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Sherezer, with Regem-Melech and his men, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. Bethel"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the house of God, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or to entreat the favor of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to pray before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to ask the priests who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the house of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of hosts, and the prophets, saying, “Should I weep in the fifth month and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. consecrate myself"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fast as I have done for so many years?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the word of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of hosts came to me, saying, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Say to all the people of the land, and to the priests: ‘When you fasted and mourned in the fifth and seventh "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "months"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " during those seventy years, did you really fast for Me—for Me? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When you eat and when you drink, do you not eat and drink "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "for yourselves?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Should you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "have obeyed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the words which the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " proclaimed through the former prophets when Jerusalem and the cities around it were inhabited and prosperous, and the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. Negev"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "South and the Lowland were inhabited?’ ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Disobedience Resulted in Captivity"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the word of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " came to Zechariah, saying, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Thus says the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of hosts:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "‘Execute true justice,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Show "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or lovingkindness"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "mercy and compassion"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Everyone to his brother."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do not oppress the widow or the fatherless,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The alien or the poor."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let none of you plan evil in his heart"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Against his brother.’"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“But they refused to heed, shrugged"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. gave a stubborn or rebellious shoulder"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " their shoulders, and stopped"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. made their ears heavy"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " their ears so that they could not hear. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yes, they made their hearts like flint, refusing to hear the law and the words which the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of hosts had sent by His Spirit through the former prophets. Thus great wrath came from the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of hosts. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore it happened, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " just as He proclaimed and they would not hear, so they called out and I would not listen,” says the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of hosts. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“But I scattered them with a whirlwind among all the nations which they had not known. Thus the land became desolate after them, so that no one passed through or returned; for they made the pleasant land desolate.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}